{
 "WorldMemBench: Does a Video World Model Remember? · REAL Lab Blog": "WorldMemBench: Does a Video World Model Remember? · REAL Lab 博客",
 "WorldMemBench tests whether video world models remember what they showed: 260 cases of controlled camera departures and repeated returns, scoring static content against a fixed reference and off-screen events with checklists. Nine models evaluated.": "视频世界模型还记得自己生成过什么吗？WorldMemBench 设计了 260 个样例，让相机按受控路径离开、再多次回到原处：静态内容和固定参考比对，画面外的事件按检查清单打分。我们评测了 9 个模型。",
 "Turn the camera away and come back: does the world a video model generated still look the same, and did what was happening keep happening?": "镜头转开再转回来，视频模型生成的世界还和原来一样吗？刚才正在发生的事，有没有接着往下走？",
