 "<a href=\"#cite\">Citation</a>": "<a href=\"#cite\">引用</a>",
 "TL;DR": "要点",
 "A video world model generates a world you can move through. Moving means things leave the frame and come back into it. A model that only produces good frames can still forget a person’s face, swap an object, rearrange a room, or freeze an event that should have kept going while the camera looked away.": "视频世界模型生成的是一个能在里面走动的世界。一走动，东西就会移出画面，过一会儿又移回来。单帧画得再好，模型也可能记错人的脸、换掉某个物体、把房间重新摆一遍，或者在镜头转开时让本该继续的事件停在原地。",
 "WorldMemBench tests this directly. In 260 cases across 23 categories, the camera follows a controlled path away from something it has seen and back, once or several times. <strong>Static content</strong>, people, objects and scenes, is compared at every return against the same reference from the start. <strong>Dynamic events</strong>, such as pages being turned or ice melting, are checked with case-specific questions about whether they progressed while out of view. Video quality and camera-following accuracy are reported alongside, so that memory scores can be read in context.": "WorldMemBench 直接测这件事。基准共 260 个样例，分 23 个类别。每个样例里，相机沿受控路径离开看过的内容再转回来，一次或多次。<strong>静态内容</strong>指人物、物体和场景，每次回来都和开头那份参考比对，参考始终不换。<strong>动态事件</strong>如翻书、冰块融化，按样例设计专门的问题，检查镜头不在时事件有没有往下推进。视频质量和相机跟随精度也一并报告，读记忆分数时可以对照着看。",
 "<strong>Across nine recent world models, the one that remembers static content best, HY-WorldPlay, starts only 31.7% of the events it is asked to show; and every model forgets more with each return.</strong> No model leads on all four dimensions.": "<strong>在九个近期的世界模型里，静态记忆最好的是 HY-WorldPlay，可指定的事件中它只让 31.7% 真正开始；而且每个模型都是回来一次，就多忘一些。</strong>四个维度上，没有一个模型全面领先。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">Static memory vs dynamic memory</p><p class=\"card-t\">Remembering is not evolving</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#revisits\"><p class=\"card-k\">Nine-model average, first to third return</p><p class=\"card-t\">Every return forgets a bit more</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#context\"><p class=\"card-k\">LingBot World v2, static memory (mean of seven metrics)</p><p class=\"card-t\">Choosing what to remember helps</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#trust\"><p class=\"card-k\">Agreement with blinded human judgments</p><p class=\"card-t\">The metrics match people</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">静态记忆 vs 动态记忆</p><p class=\"card-t\">静态记得住，动态未必跟得上</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#revisits\"><p class=\"card-k\">九个模型平均，第一次到第三次返回</p><p class=\"card-t\">每回来一次，就多忘一点</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#context\"><p class=\"card-k\">LingBot World v2 的静态记忆（七项指标均值）</p><p class=\"card-t\">有选择地保留历史帧，分数更高</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#trust\"><p class=\"card-k\">与人工盲评的一致率</p><p class=\"card-t\">指标和人的判断对得上</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>What world memory is": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>什么是世界记忆",
 "Autoregressive video generation has become long and stable enough, and camera and action control precise enough, that “video world models” now let you explore a generated place for tens of seconds. Exploration constantly moves content in and out of view. We call <strong>world memory</strong> the ability to keep what has been established, and to keep it evolving coherently, across those interruptions.": "自回归视频生成越做越长、越来越稳，相机和动作控制也足够精确，所谓“视频世界模型”已经能让人在生成的场景里探索几十秒。探索时，画面内容不断移出、移入视野。<strong>世界记忆</strong>说的就是在这种反复中断下，模型既要保住已经确立的内容，又要让它连贯地继续演化。",
 "It has two halves. <strong>Static memory</strong>: a person’s identity and clothes, an object’s look and shape, a room’s layout and depth should all be the same when you look again. <strong>Dynamic memory</strong>: something that was happening should have continued while you looked away, and its consequences should be visible when you return. Frame-level quality and local smoothness say nothing about either.": "世界记忆包含两部分。<strong>静态记忆</strong>：人物的身份和衣着、物体的外观和形状、房间的布局和深度，再看一次时都应保持不变。<strong>动态记忆</strong>：视线移开时，正在发生的事应当继续发生；视线回来时，应该能看到它带来的结果。帧级画质和局部平滑度，对这两方面都反映不出来。",
 "Earlier benchmarks examine pieces of this, such as revisit consistency, or state evolution while unobserved, and one recent benchmark tests recall across repeated loops. WorldMemBench puts them together: long revisits, repeated revisits, state evolution and physical consistency, with camera control and video quality measured in the same rollouts.": "此前已有评测基准考察过其中某些方面，例如回访一致性、无人观察时的状态演化；最近也有基准测试多轮循环之后还能不能回忆起来。WorldMemBench 把这些合到一起，覆盖长间隔回访、多次回访、状态演化和物理一致性，并在同一批 rollout 上同时测相机控制和视频质量。",
 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>Leave, and come back": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>离开与回访",
 "Every case starts from a conditioning frame, the initial view <span class=\"mi\">V</span>. The camera then follows a prescribed path that takes it away and brings it back: a departure <span class=\"mi\">D<sub>i</sub></span> followed by a revisit <span class=\"mi\">R<sub>i</sub></span>. Rotations keep the camera in place and turn it left and right (yaw) or up and down (pitch); translations keep its heading and walk a square. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> plays real rollouts from the benchmark, all generated by LingBot World v2.": "每个样例从一帧条件帧开始，即初始视图 <span class=\"mi\">V</span>。之后相机按预设路径先离开、再回来，分别记作离开 <span class=\"mi\">D<sub>i</sub></span> 和回访 <span class=\"mi\">R<sub>i</sub></span>。旋转类轨迹里，相机位置不动，只左右转（yaw）或上下转（pitch）；平移类轨迹里，相机朝向不变，沿正方形走一圈。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 播放的是基准里的真实 rollout，均由 LingBot World v2 生成。",
 "<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"2\" y=\"1.5\"></rect><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"7.4\" y=\"1.5\"></rect></svg><span>Pause</span>": "<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"2\" y=\"1.5\"></rect><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"7.4\" y=\"1.5\"></rect></svg><span>暂停</span>",
 "Loading the rollout…": "rollout 加载中…",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> The departure-and-revisit protocol on one street scene (environment case 010, generated by LingBot World v2). <b>LRLRLR</b>: the camera stays in place and turns 80° left and back three times (1° per frame, 80 frames per turn), returning at frames 160, 320 and 480. <b>LRLR</b>: two 90° turns (0.75° per frame, 120 frames per turn). <b>LRUD</b>: a 90° left–right cycle, then a 90° up–down cycle, so the second return comes along a new axis. <b>Translation</b> (a different case): the camera keeps its heading and walks forward, right, back and left around a square; the dot’s position is approximate. Each return is scored against the same initial view <span class=\"mi\">V</span>; the thumbnails fill in as the video reaches each return.": "<b>图 1：</b>以一个街景为例演示离开与回访（环境类第 010 号样例，由 LingBot World v2 生成）。<b>LRLRLR</b>：相机原地向左转 80° 再转回，重复三次（每帧 1°，每次转动 80 帧），在第 160、320、480 帧回到原位。<b>LRLR</b>：两个 90° 来回（每帧 0.75°，每次转动 120 帧）。<b>LRUD</b>：先左右转一个 90° 来回，再上下转一个 90° 来回，第二次返回换了一根轴。<b>平移</b>（另一个样例）：相机朝向不变，依次向前、向右、向后、向左，绕正方形走一圈；图中圆点的位置只是近似。每次返回都与同一个初始视图 <span class=\"mi\">V</span> 比对；视频播到哪次返回，对应的缩略图就补上哪一张。",
 "260 cases, 23 categories": "260 个样例，分属 23 个类别",
 "The benchmark has 60 Human, 70 Object and 70 Environment cases, which form the 200-case static-memory set, and 60 Dynamic cases covering seven kinds of state change: motion, assembly, removal, deformation, transfer, reaction and thermal change. Video quality is measured on all 200 static rollouts, and camera following on 85 of them whose trajectories suit pose estimation.": "静态记忆部分共 200 个样例：人物 60 个、物体 70 个、环境 70 个。动态部分另有 60 个样例，覆盖七类状态变化：运动、组装、移除、形变、转移、反应和热变化。视频质量在全部 200 段静态 rollout 上评测；相机跟随只在其中 85 段上评测，这些轨迹适合做位姿估计。",
 "Composition": "样例构成",
 "Four families, 23 categories": "四大类，23 个类别",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> Case families and their categories (paper Figure 2). Hover a block for its family.": "<b>图 2：</b>样例的四个大类及其下属类别（对应论文图 2）。鼠标悬停在色块上，可以看到它属于哪一大类。",
 "Scoring what stays": "静态记忆的评分",
 "For static content, each revisit is compared with a <strong>fixed reference</strong> from the initial view, never with the previous return, so that errors cannot hide by drifting slowly. Scores are averaged over revisits and then over targets, and a prescribed revisit with no valid observation counts as zero.": "静态内容的每次回访，都和初始视图里的<strong>固定参考</strong>比较，而不是和上一次返回比较。这样，缓慢积累的漂移就藏不住。分数先在同一目标的各次回访上取平均，再在所有目标上取平均；按计划应有的回访如果拿不到有效观测，记 0 分。",
 "<strong>People</strong>: identity from ArcFace face embeddings, and appearance from DINOv2 features inside the person’s mask.": "<strong>人物</strong>：身份看 ArcFace 人脸嵌入，外观看人物掩码区域内的 DINOv2 特征。",
 "<strong>Objects</strong>: the target is found again at each return by detection and video segmentation; appearance from DINOv2 features in the mask, and geometry as the IoU of the silhouettes after normalizing position and scale.": "<strong>物体</strong>：每次返回时，先用检测和视频分割重新找到目标。外观看掩码内的 DINOv2 特征；几何先把位置和尺度归一化，再算两个轮廓的 IoU。",
 "<strong>Environments</strong>: visible content from global DINOv2 features at the return frame whose camera orientation is closest to the start; relative depth order as the Spearman correlation of depth maps; and 3D structure by projecting both depth maps onto a shared spherical grid and comparing the reconstructed surfaces.": "<strong>环境</strong>：在返回帧中选相机朝向最接近起始朝向的一帧，可见内容用全局 DINOv2 特征比较；相对深度顺序用两张深度图的 Spearman 相关系数衡量；3D 结构则把两张深度图投到同一个球面网格上，比较重建出来的表面。",
 "Scoring what changes": "动态记忆的评分",
 "A dynamic event cannot be scored by similarity to the first frame, because the right answer is a different frame. Each dynamic case instead specifies an initial state, an action and the expected next state. A vision-language model (Qwen3.8-27B) first decides whether the event visibly starts at all; if it does not, the case scores zero. Otherwise it answers eight yes/no questions with fixed reference answers, two each on return progress, persistence, final state and causal or physical consistency. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">Figure 3</a> shows a real case.": "动态事件没法拿首帧做相似度打分，因为正确的画面本来就该和首帧不同。所以每个动态样例都写明三件事：初始状态、动作、预期的下一状态。评分时，先由视觉语言模型（Qwen3.8-27B）判断事件在画面里到底有没有开始；没开始，整个样例记 0 分。开始了，再回答八道是非题，每题都有固定的参考答案，返回时的进展、状态保持、最终状态、因果或物理一致性各两题。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">图 3</a> 是一个真实样例。",
 "hold": "静止",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> A dynamic case (case 023, generated by LingBot World v2): a hand turns the pages of a book. The camera holds, turns 60° away, holds while the pages should keep turning off-screen, turns back, and holds on the result. The eight checklist questions and their reference answers are the case’s released checklist; each lights up when the part of the video it is judged on is playing.": "<b>图 3：</b>一个动态样例（第 023 号，由 LingBot World v2 生成）：一只手在翻书。相机先停住，然后转开 60° 并停一会儿，这段时间书页应该在画面外继续翻；接着转回来，停在结果上。八个检查问题及参考答案来自该样例公开的检查清单。视频播到某个问题所依据的片段时，这个问题会亮起。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>Nine models, four dimensions": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>九个模型，四个维度",
 "We evaluate HY-WorldPlay, Matrix-Game 3 and 3.5, SANA-WM, YUME, LingBot World and LingBot World v2, Evoke and DreamX World, each with the defaults of its official release and fixed seeds, converting the benchmark trajectories into each model’s own control format.": "参评模型共九个：HY-WorldPlay、Matrix-Game 3 和 3.5、SANA-WM、YUME、LingBot World 和 LingBot World v2、Evoke、DreamX World。所有模型都用官方发布版本的默认设置，随机种子固定；基准里的相机轨迹按各模型自己的控制格式做了转换。",
 "WorldMemBench, nine models": "WorldMemBench：九个模型",
 "All metrics, coloured by rank within each metric": "全部指标，按单项排名着色",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> Full results (paper Table 2). Darker means better within a row; for the two camera errors (↓), lower is better. Hover a cell for its rank.": "<b>图 4：</b>完整结果（对应论文表 2）。同一行内颜色越深，成绩越好；两项相机误差（↓）越低越好。鼠标悬停在单元格上可查看排名。",
 "<strong>Static and dynamic memory are different skills.</strong> HY-WorldPlay leads all seven static-memory metrics, from human identity (0.828) to environment reconstruction (0.619), yet its dynamic-memory score is 0.294: it starts only 31.7% of the prescribed events. LingBot World (0.808) and YUME (0.775) lead dynamic memory while sitting in the middle on static metrics. No model leads on both: keeping the world unchanged and keeping it moving pull in different directions (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">Figure 5</a>).": "<strong>静态记忆和动态记忆是两种能力。</strong>HY-WorldPlay 的七项静态记忆指标全部第一，从人物身份（0.828）到环境重建（0.619）都是如此，动态记忆却只有 0.294：指定的事件里，它只让 31.7% 真正开始。动态记忆排在前面的是 LingBot World（0.808）和 YUME（0.775），它们的静态指标只在中游。没有模型能两头兼顾：让世界保持不变和让世界继续变化，往往互相牵制（<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">图 5</a>）。",
 "Each point is a model": "每个点是一个模型",
 "Static memory (mean of seven metrics) against dynamic memory": "静态记忆（七项指标均值）对比动态记忆",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> The horizontal axis is our average of the seven static-memory metrics in Table 2; the vertical axis is the Dynamic Memory Overall score. Point size is the imaging-quality score.": "<b>图 5：</b>横轴是我们对表 2 中七项静态记忆指标求的平均值，纵轴是动态记忆总分（Dynamic Memory Overall）。点越大，成像质量得分越高。",
 "Camera following varies independently: Matrix-Game 3 has the lowest translation error (0.424) and HY-WorldPlay the lowest rotation error (0.417), and DreamX World, with the highest of both, also has the lowest environment depth and reconstruction scores. Video quality, meanwhile, varies far less across models than memory does, and says little about it.": "相机跟随又是另一套排序。Matrix-Game 3 的平移误差最低（0.424），HY-WorldPlay 的旋转误差最低（0.417）；DreamX World 两项误差都最高，环境深度和重建得分也都垫底。视频质量则不同：模型之间的差距远小于记忆指标，也几乎看不出记忆的好坏。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>Memory fades with every return": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>返回越多，忘得越多",
 "A good first return shows that a model can recover a view once. It does not show that the recovery lasts. Under LRLRLR, the nine-model average falls from the first to the third return on all seven static metrics: object appearance by 0.229, human identity by 0.217, object geometry by 0.205 and environment reconstruction by 0.196. Per model, every one is worse at the third return than the first on the human, object, visible and reconstruction metrics.": "第一次返回表现好，只能说明模型能把视角找回来一次，不能说明它一直找得回来。在 LRLRLR 轨迹下，九个模型的平均分从第一次返回到第三次返回，七项静态指标全部下降：物体外观降了 0.229，人物身份降了 0.217，物体几何降了 0.205，环境重建降了 0.196。逐个模型看，在人物、物体、可见内容和重建这几类指标上，所有模型第三次返回都比第一次差。",
 "Two things compound. The returning viewpoint drifts: mean rotation error grows from 0.430 to 0.502 to 0.530 over the three returns. And every model generates autoregressively, so early errors feed later frames. The decline survives restricting the analysis to the 431 environment rollouts whose departures and returns meet the pose criteria: visible content, depth order and reconstruction still fall by 0.152, 0.135 and 0.139.": "下降来自两方面，而且会叠加。一是返回的视角本身在漂：三次返回的平均旋转误差依次为 0.430、0.502、0.530。二是所有模型都是自回归生成，前面的误差会一路带到后面的帧。只看离开和返回都满足位姿标准的 431 段环境 rollout，下降依然存在：可见内容、深度顺序和重建分别降了 0.152、0.135 和 0.139。",
 "One environment case, all nine models": "同一个环境样例，九个模型",
 "Visible memory at each return": "每次返回时的可见内容记忆",
 "<b>Figure 6.</b> Scores at the first, second and third return for one environment case (paper Figure 4). Hover a line to pick out a model. HY-WorldPlay and Evoke hold their scene; others lose it, sometimes abruptly.": "<b>图 6：</b>一个环境样例在第一、二、三次返回时的得分（对应论文图 4）。鼠标悬停在折线上可单独查看某个模型。HY-WorldPlay 和 Evoke 一直守得住场景；其他模型会把场景丢掉，有时是一下子丢掉。",
 "<strong>Changing direction is harder still.</strong> LRLR and LRUD share their first return but differ in the second: LRLR turns left and right again, LRUD pitches up and down. Returning along a new axis costs more for every static metric on average, and for 50 of the 63 model–metric pairs; environment visible memory drops an extra 0.152.": "<strong>换一个方向返回，难度更大。</strong>LRLR 和 LRUD 的第一次返回完全相同，区别在第二次：LRLR 仍是左右转，LRUD 改成上下转。换轴返回后，每项静态指标的平均分都掉得更多；63 个“模型–指标”组合里，有 50 个是这样。环境可见内容记忆多掉了 0.152。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>What to keep in context": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>上下文该保留哪些帧",
 "Because the benchmark separates dimensions, it can be used to diagnose design choices. Holding LingBot World v2 and all generation settings fixed, we compared three training-free ways of choosing which past frames the model attends to: the <strong>full history</strong> (FullKV), only the <strong>recent window</strong> (Sliding), and recent frames plus <strong>view-relevant history</strong> retrieved by field of view (FoV), the last two under the same budget.": "WorldMemBench 把各个维度拆开评分，所以也能拿来诊断模型设计。我们固定 LingBot World v2 和全部生成设置，比较了三种无需训练的上下文策略，区别在于模型关注哪些历史帧：<strong>全部历史</strong>（FullKV）；只看<strong>最近窗口</strong>（Sliding）；最近帧加上按视场检索的<strong>视角相关历史</strong>（FoV）。后两种的预算相同。",
 "LingBot World v2, model and settings fixed": "LingBot World v2，模型和设置均固定",
 "Memory scores under three context policies": "三种上下文策略下的记忆得分",
 "<b>Figure 7.</b> Eleven memory metrics and end-to-end latency over 660 matched videos (paper Table 3). FoV is best on eight of eleven metrics and beats Sliding on all eleven.": "<b>图 7：</b>660 段配对视频上的十一项记忆指标和端到端延迟（对应论文表 3）。十一项指标中，FoV 有八项最好，而且每一项都高于 Sliding。",
 "FoV beats the full history on all four dynamic sub-metrics and both human metrics, while full history keeps an edge on object appearance, object geometry and visible environment content. Both budgeted policies are faster: 262.7 and 260.4 seconds per video against 322.2 for full history, about 1.23× and 1.24×. Mixing recent context with view-relevant history looks like a good trade, and the benchmark shows which kinds of memory each choice helps.": "FoV 在四项动态子指标和两项人物指标上都超过全部历史；全部历史在物体外观、物体几何和环境可见内容上仍然占优。两种限定预算的策略也更快：每段视频分别用时 262.7 秒和 260.4 秒，全部历史要 322.2 秒，速度约为它的 1.23 倍和 1.24 倍。看下来，最近上下文配合视角相关历史是一个划算的折中；WorldMemBench 还能具体看出每种选择帮到的是哪一类记忆。",
 "<span class=\"n\">6</span>Do the scores agree with people?": "<span class=\"n\">6</span>自动评分和人工判断对得上吗？",
 "For static memory, three annotators judged 504 blinded pairs of rollouts. The automatic metrics agree with the human majority on 78.5% to 92.5% of decisive pairs, and model rankings correlate with human win rates up to ρ = 0.988 for visible environment memory. For dynamic memory, three annotators answered all 400 checklist items of 50 cases; the VLM judge’s overall scores correlate with theirs at Spearman ρ = 0.732 (PLCC 0.808). Causal and physical questions are the hardest to judge, at ρ = 0.401.": "静态记忆部分，三名标注者对 504 对 rollout 做了盲评。在分出高下的样本对上，自动指标和多数标注者的判断一致率在 78.5% 到 92.5% 之间；按模型排名看，与人工胜率的相关系数最高达到 ρ = 0.988（环境可见内容记忆）。动态记忆部分，三名标注者回答了 50 个样例的全部 400 道检查题，VLM 评判给出的总分与人工总分的 Spearman ρ 为 0.732（PLCC 0.808）。最难判断的是因果和物理类问题，ρ 为 0.401。",
 "Static metric": "静态指标",
 "Agreement with human majority": "与多数标注者一致的比例",
 "Model-level Spearman ρ": "模型级 Spearman ρ",
 "Environment visible": "环境可见内容",
 "Human appearance": "人物外观",
 "Human identity": "人物身份",
 "Object appearance": "物体外观",
 "Environment depth": "环境深度",
 "Object geometry": "物体几何",
 "Citation": "引用",
 "Copy": "复制",
 "References": "参考文献",
 "Inference settings for every model, the dynamic-memory prompts and the full per-trajectory results are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19063\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a>; rollouts, scores and the evaluation code are on <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/rescuerz/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hugging Face</a> and <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>.": "各模型的推理设置、动态记忆的提示词以及按轨迹拆分的完整结果，都在<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19063\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">论文</a>里；rollout、评分和评测代码已在 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/rescuerz/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hugging Face</a> 和 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> 公开。",
